  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Like Immortal Gu No, Care is a rule path Immortal Gu, in the top ten of the List of Mystical Gu. In a Gu formation, the wills activate Immortal Gu No and Immortal Gu Care; Chu Du fuses their power so Fang Yuan can breach alliance agreements without harm. The two Gu must stay activated together for that protection; once they stop, a further breach would bring severe backlash, and they do not remove the underlying restrictions completely.",
