  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave, Pang Shan tells Fang Yuan that his method can resolve alliance agreements from any path because his Immortal Gu is called Care. Care Immortal Gu is widely known as a List of Mystical Gu entry: it once sat third, then fell to fourth after Spring Autumn Cicada rose after the Yi Tian Mountain revelation. The fourth place care Gu was refined by Limitless Demon Venerable when he searched for the secluded domain of heaven and earth Care recorded in The Legends of Ren Zu. Pang Shan then sends Immortal Gu Care out of his immortal aperture; he and Not Immortal lend two rank seven Immortal Gu for Chu Du’s plan.",
        "chapters": [
          1175
        ],
